        "Title": "The Irishman &amp; The Sicilian",
        "Location": "LOCATION_COASTALTOWN",
        "PublicId": "103970524945",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/CoastalTown/_scene_octopus.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 3ed1c7e6-7707-48b4-a0f0-b933bc851fdb).Image",
        "Description": "Welcome back to Italy 47,\rWe have recived a kill order for two targets;\rMr Craig &quot;Rocco&quot; McVeigh and Mr Rico Siciliano.\r\rMcVeigh and Siciliano are both members of prestigious crime families that have been locked in a feud for the last 6 months, over a disagreement between the targets. When things settle down, these two start it all over again.\r\rThe families have decided enough is enough, and to keep the peace, have jointly contracted us to deal with the pair, keeping the families in the clear.",
